# Belt and braces, not the mechanism.
#
# The real fix is that nothing is generated IN the tree any more: netiface/run.sh
# extracts and compiles into a scratch directory, and branding/run.sh extracts
# into one too. These entries cover the case where extract.py is run on its own,
# which is a legitimate thing to do when debugging an extraction.
netiface/extracted_types.inc
netiface/extracted_impl.inc
netiface/harness
netiface/harness.build.log
